.TH CUTSCENE_ACTIVE 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
cutscene_active \- True while a cutscene scene is on the stack
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqcutscene.h\(dq
.BI "bool cutscene_active(void);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
True while a cutscene scene is on the stack. Use to suppress input handling or HUD elements in scenes beneath it.
.SH RETURN VALUE
true while a cutscene is playing.
.SH MODULE
cutscene (src/engine/cutscene/cutscene.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR cutscene_start (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
